# Never let local build artifacts or platform-specific installs leak into
# the Docker build context -- COPY portal/ . (and COPY backend/ .) would
# otherwise overwrite the container's own fresh npm ci / pip install output
# with whatever happens to be sitting on the host machine, silently baking
# stale or platform-mismatched content into the image.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.vite
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
.git
.github
.vscode
.claude
*.jsonl
